# ###########################################################################
#  USER OVERRIDES — YOUR FILE. UPDATES NEVER TOUCH IT.
#
#  This is a TEMPLATE (user.conf.example is versioned; user.conf is not).
#  The installer copies this file to ~/.config/hypr/user.conf ONCE, only when
#  it does not exist yet. After that it is yours: git ignores it, so
#  `rice update` (a tag checkout + ./install.sh) can neither overwrite nor
#  conflict with it. This file is sourced LAST, so everything here wins over
#  the rice defaults.
#
#  RULE: never edit hyprland.conf for personal tweaks — put them here.
#  Bonus: binds defined here DO show in Settings > Shortcuts (Super+K),
#  because that list parses hyprland.conf AND this file.
#
#  $mainMod is already set to SUPER above; reuse it directly.
# ###########################################################################

# Example: open the file manager on Super+Alt+F
# bind = $mainMod ALT, F, exec, uwsm app -- nautilus
